=== domain check the generated domain :: $ ployz domain check web.ada.ployz.test
error: No such domain in Environment production
valid: acme.com

=== domain check --json the generated domain :: $ ployz --json domain check web.ada.ployz.test
{"error":{"cause":[],"code":"not_found","details":{"valid_children":["acme.com"]},"message":"No such domain in Environment production"}}

